---
layout: base.njk
pagination:
  data: topics
  size: 1
  alias: topic
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ topic.name }}"
  description: "{{ topic.description }}"
  navSection: "{{ topic.section }}"
permalink: "{{ topic.path }}index.html"
---
<nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="麵包屑"><a href="{{ '/' | url }}">個人</a><span>/</span>{% if topic.section == 'research' %}<a href="{{ '/research/' | url }}">研究主題</a>{% else %}<a href="{{ '/journal/' | url }}">個人日誌</a>{% endif %}<span>/</span><span>{{ topic.name }}</span></nav>
<div class="page-intro topic-intro"><p class="eyebrow">{{ topic.english }}</p><h1>{{ topic.name }}</h1><p class="lead">{{ topic.description }}</p></div>
<nav class="topic-tabs" aria-label="同領域分類">{% for item in topics %}{% if item.section == topic.section %}<a href="{{ item.path | url }}"{% if item.id == topic.id %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ item.name }}</a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</nav>
<section class="archive-section"><div class="archive-heading"><h2>所有文章</h2><span>{{ (collections.articles | inTopic(topic.id)).length }} 篇 · 由新到舊</span></div>{% set articleList = collections.articles | inTopic(topic.id) %}{% include 'article-list.njk' %}</section>
{% if topic.id == 'quantum' %}<section class="content-section"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">STARTING POINT</p><h2>研究的起點</h2></div><div class="section-body"><p>離子阱與量子光學是我的研究背景。從光學、真空與射頻系統，到原子系統建模和實驗控制，這些經驗也成為後來工程工作的基礎。</p><a href="{{ '/research-experience/' | url }}">閱讀過往研究經驗</a></div></section>{% endif %}
